      {
        "id": 2915508,
        "name": "Alexia Chamade",
        "username": "Alexia_Chamade",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/alexia_chamade/{size}/508297_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-08-19T17:50:07.954Z",
        "cooked": "<p>love Eve as a game and have spent a lot of time and money on it. I’ve always thought that the reason Eve has lasted this long is thanks to the developers’ hard work and persistence, providing players with a good gaming environment. But recently, as I’ve been participating more in PvP battles, I’ve noticed that many players are using sync tools, and these kinds of cheat-like actions directly affect the game’s balance.</p>\n<p>And from what many players have described, most of the players who mess up the game’s balance are concentrated in one faction, which is the Peoples Liberation Army .I don’t know why the developers still haven’t explicitly banned this kind of behavior.I hope the developers can hear my faint voice and give us Eve players a long-overdue judgment of justice.</p>\n<p>Attached is my ship’s damage report. It’s clear all accounts are controlled by the same player, but I can’t understand how one person could control dozens of accounts and cause such sustained damage? How could they lock onto me simultaneously in such a short time?</p>\n<p>Finally, I want to reiterate that I truly love EVE Online. Even though the developers are relatively lenient towards cheaters, I still love the game. But as a player, I hope the developers will listen to my voice and make a fair judgment against me and other players playing in the low-security zone.</p>\n<p>Thank you very much!</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/4X/0/4/f/04fbeb4f7643a47235b3182f1219947a1ce83d02.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/I5DWs2Nv9e4WQmgIM8hdZpzUeC.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"Destroy report\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/0/4/f/04fbeb4f7643a47235b3182f1219947a1ce83d02_2_282x499.jpeg\" alt=\"Destroy report\" data-base62-sha1=\"I5DWs2Nv9e4WQmgIM8hdZpzUeC\" width=\"282\" height=\"499\" srcset=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/0/4/f/04fbeb4f7643a47235b3182f1219947a1ce83d02_2_282x499.jpeg, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/0/4/f/04fbeb4f7643a47235b3182f1219947a1ce83d02_2_423x748.jpeg 1.5x, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/optimized/4X/0/4/f/04fbeb4f7643a47235b3182f1219947a1ce83d02_2_564x998.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"242724\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Destroy report</span><span class=\"informations\">978×1732 421 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
