        "created_at": "2026-08-19T17:54:52.895Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Boxing tool do exist that are not against tos. Ie: a hotkey to swap between chars… I can often get many into a single warp bubble… And box lock can make locking extremely fast.</p>\n<p>Input broadcasting is the main thing you cannot do. But having multiple actions in a single tick is very possible.</p>",
