        "created_at": "2026-08-19T18:02:01.589Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you suspect a player of input broadcasting, you should write a ticket and report them and their alts for it. Multiboxing is okay, input broadcasting isn’t, and CCP have the metrics to determine which took place here.</p>",
