        "created_at": "2026-08-21T14:43:08.530Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No Ticket.<br>\nSupport will push you to use the Report BOT button.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/4X/1/8/d/18d514eb1ee3042a8b26d339c95d858a69e0c5ce.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/3xFZ3oBToN9rDrUxntKTtpJKgTY.png?dl=1\" title=\"grafik\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://global.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/original/4X/1/8/d/18d514eb1ee3042a8b26d339c95d858a69e0c5ce.png\" alt=\"grafik\" data-base62-sha1=\"3xFZ3oBToN9rDrUxntKTtpJKgTY\" width=\"323\" height=\"444\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">grafik</span><span class=\"informations\">323×444 66.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Rinse and repeat.<br>\nThere is a reason most of the Smartbomb Multiboxer are 30 Days old.. and not getting older.</p>",
